#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to request an IBM Quantum Classroom Account and set it up for your users"
msgstr "Paano mag-request ng IBM Quantum Classroom Account at i-set up ito para sa iyong mga user"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Classroom Account"
msgstr "Gumawa ng Classroom Account"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Classroom Account {#create-a-classroom-account}"
msgstr "Gumawa ng Classroom Account {#create-a-classroom-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum&reg; Classroom Account is a simple way for educators to set up and manage access for their students to use IBM Quantum hardware under the Open Plan, without the need to enter credit card information. The Open Plan provides 10 minutes of quantum processing unit (QPU) usage per 28-day rolling window.\n"
msgstr "Ang IBM Quantum&reg; Classroom Account ay isang simpleng paraan para sa mga educator na mag-set up at mamahala ng access para sa kanilang mga estudyante upang magamit ang IBM Quantum hardware sa ilalim ng Open Plan, nang hindi kailangang maglagay ng credit card information. Ang Open Plan ay nagbibigay ng 10 minuto ng quantum processing unit (QPU) usage kada 28-araw na rolling window.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit a request {#submit-a-request}"
msgstr "Magsumite ng request {#submit-a-request}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fill out [this form](https://ibm.biz/classroom-account) to submit a request for a Classroom Account.\n"
msgstr "Punan ang [form na ito](https://ibm.biz/classroom-account) upang magsumite ng request para sa Classroom Account.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Approved Classroom Account applicants will receive an email that contains a 32-digit feature code, which you will need during the activation process below.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga aplikanteng inaprubahan para sa Classroom Account ay makakatanggap ng email na naglalaman ng 32-digit na feature code, na kakailanganin mo sa proseso ng activation sa ibaba.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Don't forget to submit your account ID\">\n"
"If you are approved for a Classroom Account, do not delete the confirmation email you receive. In addition to the feature code, it also contains instructions for submitting your new account ID back to the IBM Quantum team so that the account can be activated. **Classroom Accounts will not be activated without this final step.**\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Huwag kalimutang isumite ang iyong account ID\">\n"
"Kung inaprubahan ka para sa Classroom Account, huwag burahin ang confirmation email na natanggap mo. Bukod sa feature code, naglalaman din ito ng mga tagubilin para sa pagsumite ng iyong bagong account ID pabalik sa IBM Quantum team upang ma-activate ang account. **Hindi mao-activate ang mga Classroom Account nang wala ang huling hakbang na ito.**\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the account {#activate-the-account}"
msgstr "I-activate ang account {#activate-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Approved Classroom Account applicants will receive an email that contains a 32-digit feature code. Do not delete this email; it contains important information for submitting your new account ID once you've set up your account, which is a required step to complete the activation. \n"
msgstr "Ang mga aplikanteng inaprubahan para sa Classroom Account ay makakatanggap ng email na naglalaman ng 32-digit na feature code. Huwag burahin ang email na ito; naglalaman ito ng mahalagang impormasyon para sa pagsumite ng iyong bagong account ID kapag na-set up mo na ang iyong account, na isang kinakailangang hakbang upang makumpleto ang activation. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have a feature code, follow the activation steps below:\n"
msgstr "Kapag mayroon ka nang feature code, sundin ang mga hakbang sa activation sa ibaba:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Do not enter credit card details\">\n"
"When creating an account with a feature code, do not provide credit card information on IBM Cloud&reg; unless you are actively upgrading to a paid account and are willing to accept being billed for consumed services.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Huwag maglagay ng credit card details\">\n"
"Kapag gumagawa ng account gamit ang feature code, huwag magbigay ng credit card information sa IBM Cloud&reg; maliban kung aktibong nag-a-upgrade ka sa isang bayad na account at handa kang tanggapin na ma-bill para sa mga nagamit na serbisyo.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visit https://cloud.ibm.com/.\n"
msgstr "Bisitahin ang https://cloud.ibm.com/.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Create account**. You must create a new account even if you have a personal IBM Cloud account, because the Classroom Account is not attached to your personal account.\n"
msgstr "I-click ang **Create account**. Kailangan mong gumawa ng bagong account kahit na mayroon ka nang personal na IBM Cloud account, dahil ang Classroom Account ay hindi nakakabit sa iyong personal na account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter a valid email address and a password. Use an email address that is **not** associated with an existing IBM Cloud account. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "Maglagay ng valid na email address at password. Gumamit ng email address na **hindi** kasalukuyang nakakabit sa isang umiiral na IBM Cloud account. I-click ang **Next**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check your email inbox for a seven-digit verification code, then return to the account creation form. Enter that code to verify your new account.\n"
msgstr "Tingnan ang iyong email inbox para sa pitong-digit na verification code, pagkatapos ay bumalik sa account creation form. Ilagay ang code na iyon upang i-verify ang iyong bagong account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Important:** In the Personal information section, do not enter your first and last name. Instead, in the \"First name\" field, enter your institutional affiliation, and in the \"Last name\" field, enter the name of the course using the account. Enter your country or region.\n"
msgstr "**Mahalaga:** Sa Personal information section, huwag ilagay ang iyong first at last name. Sa halip, sa \"First name\" field, ilagay ang iyong institutional affiliation, at sa \"Last name\" field, ilagay ang pangalan ng kurso na gagamit ng account. Ilagay ang iyong bansa o rehiyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete the Account notice and click **Continue**.\n"
msgstr "Kumpletuhin ang Account notice at i-click ang **Continue**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete the Account privacy notice and click **Continue**.\n"
msgstr "Kumpletuhin ang Account privacy notice at i-click ang **Continue**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "At the Verify identity screen, click **Register with a code**. \n"
msgstr "Sa Verify identity screen, i-click ang **Register with a code**. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter your 32-digit feature code from your confirmation email in the **Enter code** text box, then click **Create account**.\n"
msgstr "Ilagay ang iyong 32-digit na feature code mula sa confirmation email sa **Enter code** text box, pagkatapos ay i-click ang **Create account**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to your [account settings on IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/account) and copy the Account ID (found under Details). \n"
msgstr "Pumunta sa [account settings mo sa IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/account) at kopyahin ang Account ID (matatagpuan sa ilalim ng Details). \n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow the instructions in the confirmation email you received to send this ID number to the IBM Quantum team, and they will process the Classroom Account for full activation.\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga tagubilin sa confirmation email na natanggap mo upang ipadala ang ID number na ito sa IBM Quantum team, at ipoproseso nila ang Classroom Account para sa buong activation.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add users {#add-users}"
msgstr "Magdagdag ng mga user {#add-users}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, ensure you have the correct account and region selected in the account and region switchers in the[IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) header.\n"
msgstr "Una, siguraduhing napili mo ang tamang account at region sa account at region switchers sa header ng[IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select [**Access management**](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) from the main menu.\n"
msgstr "Piliin ang [**Access management**](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) mula sa main menu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the Users tab, click \"Invite user\".\n"
msgstr "Sa Users tab, i-click ang \"Invite user\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the users' email addresses. You can add multiple addresses at the same time.\n"
msgstr "Ilagay ang mga email address ng mga user. Maaari kang magdagdag ng maraming address nang sabay-sabay.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, an instance is assigned to each new user. It is recommended to accept the default setting.\n"
msgstr "Bilang default, may nakatalagang instance sa bawat bagong user. Inirerekomenda na tanggapin ang default setting.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    The instance name will automatically be based on the user's email address (without the `@` character and the domain name). In the \"Instance naming schema\" field, you can customize a prefix for each instance name; for example, if a student's email address is `john-doe@university.edu`, and you specify `physics-101` as the prefix for this account, the instance name will be `physics-101-john-doe`. If you don't specify a prefix, the default prefix `open-student` will be used (`open-student-john-doe`).\n"
"1. The user will receive an invitation to create an IBM Cloud account and join the instance. They will not need to enter credit card information to create their account. \n"
"1. After the user accepts the invitation and creates their account, they can navigate to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), where they will see their Classroom Account instance in the account switcher in the page header.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Ang pangalan ng instance ay awtomatikong batay sa email address ng user (nang wala ang `@` character at ang domain name). Sa \"Instance naming schema\" field, maaari mong i-customize ang isang prefix para sa bawat pangalan ng instance; halimbawa, kung ang email address ng isang estudyante ay `john-doe@university.edu`, at itinakda mo ang `physics-101` bilang prefix para sa account na ito, ang pangalan ng instance ay magiging `physics-101-john-doe`. Kung hindi ka nagtakda ng prefix, ang default na prefix na `open-student` ang gagamitin (`open-student-john-doe`).\n"
"1. Ang user ay makakatanggap ng imbitasyon upang gumawa ng IBM Cloud account at sumali sa instance. Hindi nila kakailanganing maglagay ng credit card information upang gumawa ng kanilang account. \n"
"1. Pagkatapos tanggapin ng user ang imbitasyon at gumawa ng kanilang account, maaari silang pumunta sa [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), kung saan makikita nila ang kanilang Classroom Account instance sa account switcher sa header ng page.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove users {#remove-users}"
msgstr "Alisin ang mga user {#remove-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove a user from a Classroom Account, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Upang alisin ang isang user mula sa Classroom Account, sundin ang mga hakbang na ito:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the Users tab, click the three-dot menu at the end of that user's row. \n"
msgstr "Sa Users tab, i-click ang three-dot menu sa dulo ng row ng user na iyon. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select Remove user. You will see a prompt to confirm that you want to remove the user from the account. Click Remove to confirm.\n"
msgstr "Piliin ang Remove user. Makikita mo ang isang prompt upang kumpirmahin na gusto mong alisin ang user mula sa account. I-click ang Remove upang kumpirmahin.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage instances {#manage-instances}"
msgstr "Pamahalaan ang mga instance {#manage-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each instance provides up to 10 minutes of QPU usage per 28-day rolling window.\n"
msgstr "Ang bawat instance ay nagbibigay ng hanggang 10 minuto ng QPU usage kada 28-araw na rolling window.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As the Classroom Account owner, you can view all activity across all instances in the account on the [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page.\n"
msgstr "Bilang may-ari ng Classroom Account, makikita mo ang lahat ng activity sa lahat ng instance sa account sa [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Student users can see data from workloads run in their own instance. They cannot see data from any other instances.\n"
msgstr "Makikita ng mga estudyanteng user ang data mula sa mga workload na pinatakbo sa kanilang sariling instance. Hindi nila makikita ang data mula sa anumang ibang instance.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Renew the Classroom Account {#renew-the-classroom-account}"
msgstr "I-renew ang Classroom Account {#renew-the-classroom-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To renew a Classroom Account that is nearing its expiration date, request a new feature code using this [renewal form](https://ibm.biz/account-renewal). \n"
msgstr "Upang i-renew ang isang Classroom Account na malapit nang mag-expire, mag-request ng bagong feature code gamit ang [renewal form na ito](https://ibm.biz/account-renewal). \n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"Direct your students to the [documentation](/guides/compute-services) for details on how to use IBM Quantum Platform. Commonly used topics include the following:\n"
"- [View backend details](/guides/qpu-information)\n"
"- [Minimize job run time](/guides/minimize-time)\n"
"- [Organize and search by job tags](/guides/add-job-tags)\n"
"- [Retrieve and save job results](/guides/save-jobs)\n"
"- [Monitor or cancel a job](/guides/monitor-job)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"Direktahin ang iyong mga estudyante sa [dokumentasyon](/guides/compute-services) para sa mga detalye kung paano gamitin ang IBM Quantum Platform. Kabilang sa mga karaniwang gamiting paksa ang mga sumusunod:\n"
"- [Tingnan ang backend details](/guides/qpu-information)\n"
"- [Bawasan ang job run time](/guides/minimize-time)\n"
"- [Ayusin at maghanap gamit ang job tags](/guides/add-job-tags)\n"
"- [Kunin at i-save ang job results](/guides/save-jobs)\n"
"- [I-monitor o i-cancel ang isang job](/guides/monitor-job)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
